<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.2 Main Results ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ QAQ: Bidirectional Semantic Coherence for Selecting High-Quality Synthetic Code Instructions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Case Study: Low RMI as Misalignment.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS3" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ QAQ: Bidirectional Semantic Coherence for Selecting High-Quality Synthetic Code Instructions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3 </span>Analysis</span></a>
