<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.3 Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ QAQ: Bidirectional Semantic Coherence for Selecting High-Quality Synthetic Code Instructions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Ablation: Disagreement vs. Consensus.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.3 Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ QAQ: Bidirectional Semantic Coherence for Selecting High-Quality Synthetic Code Instructions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Stability of RMI Across Training.</span></a></li>
