<span id="S4.T2.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Defect patterns (e.g., repetition)</span>
</span></td></tr>
